From: Julian Cooper <115541810+Juliansgith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:07:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/52] Sum the tilt arithmetic in the binary's order

Two association-order differences in the terrain/fall tilt path, each
moving the last bit of a quaternion lane:

- BuildTiltShortestArcDelta (FUN_0050CB50) sums the dot product of the
  current up axis and the half vector as (z + x) + y
  (0x0050CBC4-0x0050CBDA); the recovery summed (x + y) + z. Shared by
  COORDS_Tilt (every land unit on sloped ground) and falling props.
- COORDS_Tilt (0x0050B820) composes tiltDelta * orientation with its own
  per-lane order (0x0050B8DA-0x0050B9C4); MultiplyQuat associates the x
  and z lanes differently, so the product is now spelled out inline.

Found by replaying an FAF recording: a falling tree's orientation
drifted a few float ulps from the shipped engine's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8875086bb3115564d1d0051b7b242c3c5a5e6dba)
(cherry picked from commit 5ca561a3ffad337b8c059930abd336e94f9a707b)
---
 src/sdk/moho/entity/Entity.cpp       | 13 ++++++++++++-
 src/sdk/moho/math/QuaternionMath.cpp |  3 ++-
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/entity/Entity.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/entity/Entity.cpp
index db946089..3d56bf35 100644
--- a/src/sdk/moho/entity/Entity.cpp
+++ b/src/sdk/moho/entity/Entity.cpp
@@ -7855,7 +7855,18 @@ namespace moho
 
     Wm3::Quaternionf tiltDelta{};
     (void)BuildTiltShortestArcDelta(surfaceNormal, &tiltDelta, currentUp);
-    *orientation = MultiplyQuat(tiltDelta, oldOrientation);
+
+    // tiltDelta * oldOrientation, each lane summed in the binary's order
+    // (0x0050B8DA-0x0050B9C4); MultiplyQuat associates the x and z lanes
+    // differently, which moves their last bit.
+    const Wm3::Quaternionf& d = tiltDelta;
+    const Wm3::Quaternionf& o = oldOrientation;
+    Wm3::Quaternionf tilted{};
+    tilted.w = (((o.w * d.w) - (o.x * d.x)) - (o.y * d.y)) - (o.z * d.z);
+    tilted.x = (((o.z * d.y) + (o.x * d.w)) + (o.w * d.x)) - (o.y * d.z);
+    tilted.y = (((o.w * d.y) + (o.x * d.z)) + (o.y * d.w)) - (o.z * d.x);
+    tilted.z = (((o.w * d.z) + (o.z * d.w)) + (o.y * d.x)) - (o.x * d.y);
+    *orientation = tilted;
   }
 
   /**
diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/math/QuaternionMath.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/math/QuaternionMath.cpp
index 55c7167c..fae4c0f7 100644
--- a/src/sdk/moho/math/QuaternionMath.cpp
+++ b/src/sdk/moho/math/QuaternionMath.cpp
@@ -995,7 +995,8 @@ namespace moho
     };
     (void)Wm3::Vector3f::Normalize(&halfAxis);
 
-    const float scalar = (currentUp.x * halfAxis.x) + (currentUp.y * halfAxis.y) + (currentUp.z * halfAxis.z);
+    // 0x0050CBC4-0x0050CBDA sum the dot product as (z + x) + y.
+    const float scalar = ((currentUp.z * halfAxis.z) + (currentUp.x * halfAxis.x)) + (currentUp.y * halfAxis.y);
     outDelta->w = scalar;
     if (scalar == 0.0f) {
       // Exactly opposed: the half-vector is degenerate, so pick an axis
